                                "sense_id": "344c414e-9831-32b2-9e3d-a8d195218162",
                                "text": "Small trades-folk, male and female shop-walkers, better class artisans, lower middle-class women worn with household cares, occasional young folk in search of a sensation—these were the impressions which the audience conveyed to the trained observation of Malone."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5021b1cf-2d60-4fa1-be9a-94ad150c9bb8",
                                "sense_id": "344c414e-9831-32b2-9e3d-a8d195218162",
                                "text": "The shop-walkers behaved curiously, too. As the little group passed they bowed to Maia as though she were a Queen."
                            }
                        ]
